EaJT65YBZvG_sL.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 🏆 央媒集体祝贺BLG夺冠，全华班3比1赢Gen，首次捧起S赛奖杯，Knight拿下国产首个FMVP。</span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnB6X8F75li8vTEaJT65YBZvG_sL.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 🏆 BLG三比一胜GEN夺S16冠军，淘汰赛连克四支LCK队伍，LPL时隔1834天再捧杯，跨圈祝贺刷屏。</span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnB6X8F75li8vTEaJT65YBZvG_sL.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a> 🎙️ JackeyLove评BLG夺冠含金量高：本质四比零，中上野压制，Knight圆梦显老将价值。</span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnB6X8F75li8vTEaJT65YBZvG_sL.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 🎮 B站为BLG夺冠送7天大会员，24小时内搜大会员就能领，超2000万人见证，弹幕破330万。</span><br></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnB6X8F75li8vTEaJT65YBZvG_sL.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> 🏆 BLG夺冠后Uzi以名宿身份举起奖杯，圆梦梗再引电竞情怀共鸣，也让老玩家完成一次情感和解。</span><br><br><span>📻 《热搜来电》— 每日傍晚与你准时相会</span><br><span>高效获取 | 专业解读 | 理性分析 | 为你量身定制</span><br><span>💬 你最关注今天哪个热点？评论区来电聊聊～ </span></p>]]></description>
